From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] Run lambda remapping cases with method-level parameters

Pass both upstream remapper streams to their test methods. JUnit 5.12
supports these parameterized tests without class-level parameter injection.

Upstream: downstream adaptation to JUnit 5.12
Reference: https://gitlab.ow2.org/asm/asm/-/blob/ASM_9_10_1/asm-commons/src/test/java/org/objectweb/asm/commons/LambdaRemapTest.java
Signed-off-by: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
